{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-30-1","title":"Psalms 30:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David praises God for his deliverance. 4 He exhorts others to praise him by example of God's dealings with him.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2987. B.C. 1017. (Title.) A psalm.Or, \"A psalm or song of David, at the dedication of the house;\" by which is supposed to be meant the place he built on the threshing floor of Araunah, after the grievous plague which had nearly desolated the kingdom.</p>\n<p>2Sa 24:25; 1Ch 21:6 at the. De 20:5; 2Sa 5:11; 6:20; 7:2; 20:3 extol. 34:3,4; 66:17; 145:1; Da 4:37 for. 27:6; 28:9 hast not. 13:4; 25:2; 35:19,24,25; 41:11; 79:4,10; 89:41-46; 140:8; La 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-2","title":"Psalms 30:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>and. 6:2; 51:8; 103:3,4; 107:17-22; 118:18; 147:3; Ge 20:17; Ex 15:26 2Ki 20:5; Jas 5:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-3","title":"Psalms 30:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>brought. 16:10; 40:1,2; 56:13; 71:20; 86:13; *marg: 116:8; Job 33:19-22,28; Isa 38:17,18; Jon 2:4-6 down. 28:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-4","title":"Psalms 30:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Sing. 32:11; 33:1-3; 97:12; 103:20-22; 132:9; 135:19-21; 148:14; 149:1 1Ch 16:4; Re 19:5,6 at the remembrance. or, to the memorial. 97:12; *marg: holiness. Ex 15:11; Isa 6:3; Re 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-5","title":"Psalms 30:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>For. 103:9,17; Isa 26:20; 54:7,8; 57:15,16; 2Co 4:17 his anger, etc. Heb. there is but a moment in his anger. inhis. 16:11; 36:7-9; 63:3; Re 22:1,17 weeping. 6:6-9; 56:8-11; 126:5,6; Isa 38:3-5; Mt 5:4; Joh 16:20-22 2Co 7:9,10 for a night. Heb. in the evening. joy. Heb. singing. inthe. 46:5; *marg: 59:16; 143:8; Ge 32:24; *marg: Ho 6:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-6","title":"Psalms 30:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>And. Job 29:18-20; Isa 47:7; 56:12; Da 4:30; Lu 12:19; 2Co 12:7 I shall. 15:5; 16:8; 119:117</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-7","title":"Psalms 30:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>by thy. 5; 5:12; 18:35,36; 44:3; 89:17; Job 10:12 made, etc. Heb. settled strength for my mountain. 40:2; 1Ch 17:26,27 thou. 10:1; 13:1,2; 102:10; 104:29; 143:7; Job 30:26-31; Isa 38:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-8","title":"Psalms 30:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>unto. 34:6; 77:1,2; 130:1,2; 1Co 12:8,9; Php 4:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-9","title":"Psalms 30:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>What. 6:5; 88:10-12; 115:17,18; 118:17; Ec 9:10; Isa 38:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-10","title":"Psalms 30:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Hear. 51:1,2; 143:1,7-9 be thou. 28:7; 54:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-11","title":"Psalms 30:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>turned. 5; 126:1,2; Ge 37:35; 45:28; 2Ch 20:3,9,12,27,28; Es 9:22; Isa 25:8 3 Isa 66:10,11 Joh 16:20 Re 7:14-17 21:4 dancing. 149:3; 150:4; 2Sa 6:14; Ec 3:4; Jer 31:4,13,14 girded. Ne 8:10; Isa 61:3,10; Lu 15:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-30-12","title":"Psalms 30:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":30,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":30,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>my glory. that is, my tongue, or my soul. 16:9; 57:8; Ge 49:6 and. Lu 19:40; Ac 4:20 I will. 13:6; 71:14,23; 145:2; 146:1,2; Re 4:8,9; 7:12</p>"}]}